{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19880110_P005-Q22", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主在2004时发生了什么事？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字：丁卯年、癸丑月、甲子日、丁卯时，日主甲木生于丑月，土旺木囚，但得子水正印生扶，时柱丁卯木火相生，整体身偏弱但印星有力。2004年为甲申年，流年天干甲木比肩助身，地支申金为七杀，与月支丑土暗合（申丑合），且申金冲克日支子水（申子半合水局但被冲），主变动、压力与意外。\n\n2004年命主16岁，正值读书阶段。流年申金七杀冲印星子水，印星代表学业、学校，被冲则学业有变；七杀主意外、冲突，且申金为驿马，主走动、离家。结合选项，A（被赶出学校）符合印星受损、七杀攻身的象；B（车祸伤手脚）虽也有意外象，但申金冲子水更应于学业中断而非单纯外伤；C（比赛得名）为吉象，与七杀冲印不符；D（离家做学徒）虽也有驿马象，但七杀冲印更直接指向学业问题，且“被赶出学校”更贴合印星被冲克、名声受损的象。\n\n综合判断，A最符合命理逻辑。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITH_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": null, "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_off", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "malaysia_male_19880110_P005-Q22", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6d\\runs\\phase6-6d-v1-20260808-r1\\dev\\2025_b1a_time_off_r1_g1\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 3737, "response_id": "47181bfe-50ac-4c75-9760-c0caa9f98549", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 245, "completion_tokens": 303, "total_tokens": 548, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 117}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19880110_P005-Q23", "domain": "relationship", "question": "命主在那一年结婚？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字：丁卯年、癸丑月、甲子日、丁卯时。日主甲木生于丑月，土旺木囚，但得子水正印生身，时支卯木为根，整体身偏弱但印比有助。婚姻看日支（配偶宫）为子水，子水为印星，代表配偶贤惠或年龄较大，且子丑合，月支丑土与日支子水相合，婚姻宫被合动，主早婚或适婚年龄有婚缘。\n\n大运方面，命主为男性，生于丁卯年（阴年），大运逆排。月柱癸丑，逆排为壬子、辛亥、庚戌、己酉、戊申、丁未等。起运年龄约在出生后3岁（1988年+3=1991年起运），每十年一运。  \n- 1991-2000：壬子运（印旺，学业为主）  \n- 2001-2010：辛亥运（官杀透，事业起步）  \n- 2011-2020：庚戌运（七杀透，压力大，但戌为财库，有婚恋机会）  \n- 2021-2030：己酉运（正财合身，财星透干，利于婚姻）\n\n在庚戌运中，2016年丙申，申子半合水局，冲动婚姻宫，但申金为七杀，压力大，且丙火食神透出，可能恋爱但非稳定。2017年丁酉，酉金为正官，与日支子水相破（子酉破），感情有波折，且丁火伤官透，不利婚。  \n进入己酉运后，2021年辛丑，辛金正官透出，丑土合子水（婚姻宫），且流年与月柱伏吟，有婚动之象。2022年壬寅，寅木冲时支卯木，但婚姻宫子水未动，且壬水印星透，可能因学业或长辈因素推迟。  \n综合看，2021年辛丑，正官星透干合身，且丑土合动婚姻宫，是最明显的婚期。  \n\n最终答案：A", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITH_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": null, "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_off", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "malaysia_male_19880110_P005-Q23", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6d\\runs\\phase6-6d-v1-20260808-r1\\dev\\2025_b1a_time_off_r1_g1\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 6290, "response_id": "97f796c6-da34-470b-9e30-b5343556eaba", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 206, "completion_tokens": 491, "total_tokens": 697, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 78}, "requested_model": 