{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q29", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主在2021年，发生何事？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字：癸丑年、庚申月、壬辰日、壬子时。日主壬水生于申月，金水两旺，身强无疑。喜用神为火土（财官），忌神为金水。\n\n2021年为辛丑年。流年天干辛金为正印（忌神），地支丑土为正官（喜神，但丑为湿土，且与命局丑、辰、子会合水局，土性被泄，官星力量大减）。大运方面，命主生于1973年，2021年虚岁49岁，行至癸亥大运（约40-50岁），亥水为忌神，且亥子丑三会水局，水势滔天，冲克喜神午火（若有），但命局无午，则水泛木浮，财星（火）被严重克制。\n\n流年辛丑，印星透干，主长辈、文书、房产等，但印为忌，主压力、阻滞。地支丑土官星被合化为水，官星（事业、工作）被化，主事业上失去控制力，且水多主流动、散乱，生意资金链断裂之象。同时，2021年疫情背景下，命局水旺无制，财星（火）全无，主财运极差，资金周转困难。时柱壬子为比肩，比劫夺财，更显破财之象。\n\n综合判断，2021年命主事业财运大败，生意难以维持，符合选项A的描述。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITH_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": null, "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_off", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q29", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6d\\runs\\phase6-6d-v1-20260808-r1\\dev\\2025_b1a_time_off_r1_g1\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4949, "response_id": "eba9f018-a076-486a-a7ed-ac40ed726359", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 241, "completion_tokens": 344, "total_tokens": 585, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 113}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q30", "domain": "health", "question": "命主在2024年的健康状况如何？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字：癸丑年、庚申月、壬辰日、壬子时。日主壬水生于申月得令，地支申子辰三合水局，天干双壬透出，水势极旺，属于身强水泛之象。八字中金水过旺，而火土弱，木星不显。\n\n2024年为甲辰年，流年天干甲木为食神，地支辰土为七杀。甲木食神被旺水所泄，且辰土与命局中申子辰再会水局，水势更旺，形成“水多木漂”之象。食神代表健康、饮食、排泄，被水冲克，容易有代谢或饮食失控问题。同时，水旺克火（火为心脏、血液循环），但命局火弱极，反而不显。\n\n流年地支辰土为七杀，与日支辰伏吟，且辰为水库，加重水势。七杀主压力、意外、筋骨损伤，但水旺土虚，七杀无力制水，反而被水反克，代表外部压力或意外难以形成实质伤害。然而，水过旺则主寒湿，易导致关节、骨骼问题，尤其是久坐或姿势不良引发的脊椎问题（水主肾、骨，辰为湿土主肌肉）。\n\n综合来看，命主水势泛滥，食神受损，最可能体现为饮食不节、肥胖（水多主湿胖），但选项A过于轻描淡写；选项B“久坐脊椎侧弯”符合水旺湿重、筋骨失养之象，且流年辰土伏吟日支，主身体结构问题；选项C“鼻癌”需金旺克木，但木弱不显，且无火土引发，可能性低；选项D“车祸骨折”需七杀有力或冲刑，但水旺土虚，意外难成。\n\n因此，最符合命理逻辑的是B。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITH_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": null, "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_off", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q30", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6d\\runs\\phase6-6d-v1-20260808-r1\\dev\\2025_b1a_time_off_r1_g1\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 6460, "response_id": "44066187-8db4-415b-b2a2-89fc6fa7a302", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 238, "completion_tokens": 429, "total_tokens": 667, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 110}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "think